     "review": [
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "I've made this recipe twice. The first time I used reliable Nestle's semi-sweet chocolate chips, and it was delicious. The second time I made it with espresso chocolate chips, and it was over the top astounding! (I am a coffee lover, so take that into consideration.)\r\n\r\nBy the way, I think your note about it keeping in the refrigerator for two weeks is complete nonsense. It disappears WAY faster than that! :-)",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Jim"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-08-06"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "This is perfect! Very rich and so simple  and quick to prepare. Won't be able to keep enough ice cream in the freezer. Wish there was as simple a recipe for caramel sauce",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Sherrie Curtis"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-06-16"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
