       },
       "datePublished": "2026-06-14"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "Wow!! I didn’t have high expectations with this recipe…. It def shocked me!! Taste just like hot fudge!! Thank you for sharing!",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Krystal"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-06-09"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "4"
       },
       "reviewBody": "This was a good chocolatey sauce.  I wanted it a bit fudgier.  I added 4 T hershey baking cocoa and fine sea salt.  Yes it gets firmer as it sets perfect for ice cream.  It was so good.  I'll keep making this forever.",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Wendy"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-05-24"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "We unfortunately are lactose intolerant as a family. Genetics, thanks.\r\n\r\nWe made this with coconut milk sweetened condensed milk and lactose free margarine, added a splash of vanilla, and otherwise followed it exactly.\r\n\r\nIt was so good. Thank you.",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Kelli"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-05-24"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "I loved this..... it fast perfect thickness, and fast.What's not to like.  Thank you for sharing this.",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "LeighAnn Mejia"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-05-22"
      },
      {
